	annote = {The following values have no corresponding Zotero field:auth-address: MRC Integrative Epidemiology Unit, University of Bristol, Bristol BS8 2BN, UK. UK Centre for Tobacco and Alcohol Studies, School of Experimental Psychology, University of Bristol, 12a Priory Road, Bristol BS8 1TU, UK. Department of Psychology, University of Virginia, Charlottesville, Virginia 22904, USA. Center for Open Science, Charlottesville, Virginia 22903, USA. Department of Experimental Psychology, University of Oxford, 9 South Parks Road, Oxford OX1 3UD, UK. Department of Psychology, University of Bath, Bath BS2 7AY, UK. Cardiff University Brain Research Imaging Centre, School of Psychology, Cardiff University, Cardiff CF24 4HQ, UK. National Centre for the Replacement, Refinement and Reduction of Animals in Research (NC3Rs), London NW1 2BE, UK. The Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania 19104, USA. Department of Psychology, University of Amsterdam, Amsterdam 1018 WT, Netherlands. CHDI Management/CHDI Foundation, New York, New York 10001, USA. Meta-Research Innovation Center at Stanford (METRICS), Stanford University, Stanford 94304, California, USA. Stanford Prevention Research Center, Department of Medicine and Department of Health Research and Policy, Stanford University School of Medicine, Stanford 94305, California, USA. Department of Statistics, Stanford University School of Humanities and Sciences, Stanford 94305, California, USA.accession-num: 33954258custom1: Competing interests M.R.M, together with C.D.C and D.V.M.B., has received funding from the BBSRC (grant number BB/N019660/1) to convene a workshop on advanced methods for reproducible science, and is chair of the CHDI Foundation Independent Statistical Standing Committee. B.A.N. is executive director of the non-profit Center for Open Science with a mission to increase openness, integrity and reproducibility of research. N.P.d.S. leads the NC3Rs programme of work on experimental design,