	annote = {The following values have no corresponding Zotero field:auth-address: Department of General Education, Graduate School of Nursing Science, St. Luke's International University, Tokyo, Japan. edward-barroga@slcn.ac.jp. Department of Biological Sciences, Messiah University, Mechanicsburg, PA, USA.edition: 20220425accession-num: 35470596custom1: The authors have no potential conflicts of interest to disclose.},
